	(text "[■] POINT 03: TH1 THERMISTOR DNP ASSIGNMENT\n    • Set TH1 symbol attribute to DNP (Do Not Populate) in the pcb layout.\n    • Exclude TH1 explicitly from both the exported Bill of Materials (BOM) \n      and Pick & Place (CPL) files.\n    • Retain the TH1 symbol and footprint on the schematic/PCB layout for \n      documentation and bench testing fallback with 2-wire battery packs.\n\n[■] POINT 04: POWER SUPPLY REGULATOR SEPARATION \n    • Remove FB1 bridging net +3.3V and net +3.3VA between U2 and U3 outputs.\n    • Ensure U2 (+3.3V digital supply) and U3 (+3.3VA clean analog supply) \n      outputs are physically and electrically isolated.\n    • Verify +3.3VA is powered exclusively by U3 to prevent high-frequency \n      digital switching noise from coupling into the analog front-end."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92.202 156.464 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8184a2bc-dd7f-42fd-a313-f450f3813e3a")
	)
