	(text "[■] POINT 01: D7 POWER INDICATOR RAIL MIGRATION & SOFTWARE CONTROL\n    • Migrate D7 LED anode from continuous +BATT rail to MCU GPIO IO41 \n      (Pin 34) through R23 (1 kΩ) series resistor.\n    • Eliminate continuous 2 mA-5 mA quiescent power drain during sleep \n      and enable dynamic software-controlled indication.\n\n[■] POINT 02: DELIVERABLE SYNCHRONIZATION & DESIGN RULE VERIFICATION\n    • Re-generate and synchronize KiCad netlist, 4-layer PCB layout, \n      BOM, CPL, and RS-274X Gerber export files.\n    • Re-run ERC and DRC verification to guarantee zero errors and zero \n      warnings across all release deliverables."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.478 154.686 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
